eck to the King on h7\n- The King cannot capture the Queen (no piece defends it adequately)\n- The King cannot move to g8 (controlled by Queen on f7)\n- The King cannot move to g7 (controlled by Queen on f7)\n- The King cannot move to h8 (still in check from Queen on f7)\n- No Black piece can block or capture the Queen on f7\n\nThis appears to be checkmate!\n\nReason: Q: h5-f7 delivers checkmate. The Black King on h7 is trapped with no escape squares and no way to capture or block the checking Queen. This is a forced win in one move.\n\nAnswer: Q: h5-f7"}
