 I maintain a dominant queen position\n- It keeps maximum pressure and doesn't allow Black any counterplay\n\nReason: Q: f8-g7 delivers check while maintaining an aggressive queen position deep in Black's position. This forcing move keeps Black's king under constant pressure and doesn't give them time to coordinate their pieces or create threats against my somewhat exposed king on e1. The check forces Black to respond defensively while I maintain all my attacking options.\n\nAnswer: Q: f8-g7"}
