lent outpost on c6\n- It maintains pressure and initiative\n- After the king moves, I can continue to coordinate my pieces for a winning attack\n\nThis forcing move keeps Black on the defensive and exploits the exposed king position maximally.\n\nAnswer: N: b4-c6"}
