ed but could be even more effective.\n\nReason: The pawn on g3 poses an immediate tactical threat to my King's safety. Capturing it with **P: f2-g3** accomplishes multiple goals: (1) eliminates a dangerous advanced pawn, (2) opens the f-file for potential Rook activity, (3) improves King safety. This is a concrete improvement to my position while removing Black's most advanced and threatening piece.\n\nAnswer: P: f2-g3"}
