es very active, controlling the 7th rank and keeping pressure on Black's position; (3) It removes a key defender near the Black King; (4) This maintains my winning advantage and brings me closer to converting the position. In endgames with material advantage, simplification through advantageous exchanges is a key winning principle.\n\nAnswer: R: f1-f7"}
