ins central space and restricts Black's pieces\n- Seizes the initiative in this endgame\n- The pawn becomes a significant asset as it advances toward promotion\n\nThis move transforms the position dynamically and puts immediate pressure on Black's king, which is the key piece to attack in the endgame.\n\nAnswer: P: d4-d5"}
