g central position\n- It activates my rook with tempo\n- After the king moves, I can potentially use my rook to cut off the Black king or attack Black's pawns\n- It seizes the initiative rather than playing defensively\n- The 5th rank is an excellent location for my rook in this endgame\n\nAnswer: R: f1-f5"}
