, d4, d5, f3, f4, or f5. After the king moves, I can continue to harass it with my rook while improving my position. Giving check gains tempo and disrupts Black's coordination. This is a fundamental principle in endgames - use checks to seize the initiative.\n\n**Answer:** R: c2-e2"}
