-e5** is clearly the best move because:\n- It gives check, forcing Black's king to move\n- After the king moves (likely Kf6, Kf4, or Kg6), the Black rook on g5 becomes vulnerable\n- If Kf6, I can play Rxg5, winning the rook\n- If Kf4, I can play Rxg5, winning the rook  \n- If Kg6, I can play Rxg5+, winning the rook with check\n- This is a forcing, winning tactical blow\n\nAnswer: R: e6-e5"}
