 b2xc3, I:\n- Eliminate Black's most dangerous asset\n- Simplify the position in my favor\n- Maintain material advantage (Rook + Bishop vs Rook)\n- Remove immediate tactical threats\n\nWhile R: e4-e5 attacking the rook looks tempting, after the rook moves, Black still has the dangerous c3 pawn. Eliminating this threat takes priority.\n\nAnswer: P: b2-c3"}
