ndgames, when your pawn is far advanced and the opposing king is too far away to catch it, immediate pawn advancement is usually correct. The Black king cannot stop the pawn from promoting, and once I get a queen, the game is won. Delaying with king moves allows Black's king to get closer to the pawn.\n\nAnswer: P: h5-h6"}
